tags: studio
studioTitle: "Receipt logo — printed"
studioCategory: "Square"
studioSize: "400 × 200 px · pure black and white"
studioNote: "For the paper receipt printer. Square prints a logo at most 400 × 200 and wants at least 200 × 200, strictly black and white: no grey, no color, and no transparency (a transparent background prints as a black block). This is black ink on solid white with edge smoothing switched off, so every pixel is one or the other."
studioW: 800
studioH: 400
# Drawn at 800 × 400 and exported at half, 400 × 200: the most Square prints
# (a taller upload is refused, 2026-10-26), and headless Chrome won't open a
# window under about 500px wide. crispEdges keeps it pure black and white at
# the smaller size too; check the PNG has only two colours after any change.
studioExportScale: 0.5
studioOrder: 62
---
